{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":1,"common":false,"etymology":["日本国(こく)字(じ) (kokuji)。 可能與上古日語 かたし (katashi)相關，對照現代日語堅い (かたい, katai)。 朝鮮語 가시나무 (gasinamu)，在语音和语义上几乎完全吻合，可能是古代从日本-琉球語系中借来。"],"examples":[{"en":"He cut some branches off the oak tree.","ja":"彼はカシの木の枝を何本か切り取った。","ref":"289524_114148","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Are there oak trees on the hill?","ja":"丘の上にかしの木がはえていますか。","ref":"19874_182753","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"An old oak is groaning in the storm.","ja":"樫の老木が嵐にうめいている。","ref":"21243_184115","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Age brandy in oak casks.","ja":"ブランデーを、カシのたるにねかせる。","ref":"34131_196951","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The morning after I arrived there, I took a walk into the woods of oaks.","ja":"そこへついた日の翌朝、私は樫の木の森へ散歩した。","ref":"50890_213603","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["樫","橿","櫧","檍"],"glosses":["evergreen oak"],"id":"1207690","lemma":"樫","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カシ","readings":["かし","かしい","カシ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/樫#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/樫/樫/樫.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["青剛櫟"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["青剛櫟"],"pos":"n"}]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":["與串 (kushi)同源。"],"examples":[{"en":"He doesn't bother to comb his hair.","ja":"彼はわざわざ髪にくしをかけたりしない。","ref":"293427_110261","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I have a wooden comb.","ja":"私は木のくしを持っています。","ref":"261969_152580","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Comb your hair before you go out.","ja":"外出する前に髪を櫛でときなさい。","ref":"21859_184731","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"This is a wooden comb.","ja":"これは木のくしです。","ref":"55385_218074","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Lend me your comb for a minute, will you?","ja":"くしを少しの間貸してくれませんか。","ref":"63034_225696","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["櫛"],"glosses":["comb"],"id":"1246490","lemma":"櫛","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"クシ","readings":["くし","クシ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/櫛#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/櫛/櫛/櫛